equivalent multiplier = expected stage total (mean hand x submissions per stage) with the card / without it.
growth cards are listed twice: at growth 0 (as bought) and at the stated mid-run growth:
  C54 连庄: growth 9 = 3 consecutive same-primary submissions (x1.45)
  C55 积少成多: growth 40 = 20 submissions (+40 base)
  C56 深蓝: growth 20 = 10 submissions without red (x2.0)
  C57 红火: growth 24 = 8 submissions with a red group of 3+ (x2.2)
  C58 老当益壮: growth 32 = 8 stages cleared (x2.6)
  C59 余勇可贾: growth 32 = 8 unused submissions (+32 base)
  C60 千锤百炼: growth 12 = 6 die-face upgrades bought (x1.6)
  C61 学无止境: growth 20 = 10 hand/colour levels gained (x2.0)
  C62 熟能生巧: growth 50 = 50 rolls thrown (+50 base)
  C90 玻璃心: growth 30 = 2 glass dice broken (x2.5)
  C100 祭坛: growth 20 = 10 gold of controllers sacrificed (x2.0)
  C129 屠龙者: growth 30 = 3 boss stages cleared (x2.5)
  C132 高压锅: growth 36 = 3 pressure challenges completed (x2.8)
  C134 物尽其用: growth 30 = 10 items used (x2.5)
  C141 昙花一现: growth 2 = 2 stages after purchase (x2.0; x3 when bought, gone after 4 stages)
cards measured in a stated situation (applied to both builds): C130 首领关; C135 背包里有2个道具; C137 带1颗临时骰; C138 钱包30金（每次提交另付3金）; C139 钱包40金
non-scoring cards measured through their effect: C136 折算：每关多1颗标准临时骰; C128 折算：1颗骰子变玻璃（第1关；不计碎裂损失）
dice-changing cards are listed again after 6 and 12 stages of ordinary play with the card (rows @s6 / @s12: three hands per stage, dice changed by the real after-score plans; the only steering is the bot's order tie-break for C117 / C119 / C127): C07 C15 C26 C36 C37 C38 C117 C118 C119 C120 C121 C122 C123 C124 C125 C126 C127

